Description: CellSight is a GPL-3.0-licensed toolkit for generating interactive
  Shiny applications for single-cell multi-omics and spatial transcriptomics
  data. This project includes modifications and extensions derived from
  ShinyCell2 (the-ouyang-lab/ShinyCell2), while preserving GPL-3.0 license
  terms and required attribution notices.
